{"2765790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreadweave", "steam_appid": 2765790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/789519719ee3f154e9889cafd33f7a53.avif?t=1785069274\" width=800 height=3000 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in a sealed-off town deep in the Far North. A secret experiment has gone catastrophically wrong, shattering reality into two realms: our world and the Other Side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside your underground base, enemies wait around every corner. Explore the city, collect resources, craft gear - but remember: panic is more dangerous than bullets. A creature hunts you by tracking your heartbeat. The higher your pulse, the closer IT gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as a lone operative: upgrade your equipment, fortify your shelter, master both worlds, and fight for survival - until you unravel the city’s darkest secret.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, snow-covered Soviet-era city with changing weather, day and night cycles, cunning enemies, ever-changing - and no two raids are ever alike. Every trip into the city is a unique experience. Get out in time… or lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/dc66ac9a8651b6a6ea34387156f965e8.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/dc66ac9a8651b6a6ea34387156f965e8.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/dc66ac9a8651b6a6ea34387156f965e8.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather and Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the massive city to scavenge for loot - ammo, medicine, gear, resources, and rare items. Bring it all back to the bunker and use it wisely to upgrade your equipment and shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/ed6ab17dcf47dc149e777c706cf8d952.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/ed6ab17dcf47dc149e777c706cf8d952.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/ed6ab17dcf47dc149e777c706cf8d952.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Other Side</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles aren't just in the real world - you can enter The Other Side and face a terrifying enemy face to face. Time here is limited by your air supply, but only here can you find the most valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/4bc5a4e12936c4d9363cecda1fcb1429.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/4bc5a4e12936c4d9363cecda1fcb1429.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/4bc5a4e12936c4d9363cecda1fcb1429.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Monster That Senses Your Fear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your heartbeat - it can give you away! Once you panic, there's no escaping THE ENTITY. It's already on your trail. Can you stay calm when it matters most?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/a1bfe89aedf3533d607a988e3d380a49.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/a1bfe89aedf3533d607a988e3d380a49.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/a1bfe89aedf3533d607a988e3d380a49.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up and Prepare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience and resources to upgrade your gear. Grow your abilities through a branching skill tree and shape your own playstyle. Every raid makes your character stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/c46d97475be1d5a1460c41cc087d271e.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/c46d97475be1d5a1460c41cc087d271e.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/c46d97475be1d5a1460c41cc087d271e.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Missions and Uncover Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on quests, talk to survivors, and piece together the truth behind the catastrophe. Which side will you choose - the military or the scientists? Or is the truth hidden in The Other Side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/403f762dab15cc9ae87ca9cfc485f33e.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/403f762dab15cc9ae87ca9cfc485f33e.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/403f762dab15cc9ae87ca9cfc485f33e.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter your choice, remember: with every heartbeat, IT draws closer.<br>Stay calm. And good luck!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in a sealed-off town deep in the Far North. A secret experiment has gone catastrophically wrong, shattering reality into two realms: our world and the Other Side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside your underground base, enemies wait around every corner. Explore the city, collect resources, craft gear - but remember: panic is more dangerous than bullets. A creature hunts you by tracking your heartbeat. The higher your pulse, the closer IT gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as a lone operative: upgrade your equipment, fortify your shelter, master both worlds, and fight for survival - until you unravel the city’s darkest secret.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, snow-covered Soviet-era city with changing weather, day and night cycles, cunning enemies, ever-changing - and no two raids are ever alike. Every trip into the city is a unique experience. Get out in time… or lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sha