 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/4bc5a4e12936c4d9363cecda1fcb1429.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/4bc5a4e12936c4d9363cecda1fcb1429.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Monster That Senses Your Fear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your heartbeat - it can give you away! Once you panic, there's no escaping THE ENTITY. It's already on your trail. Can you stay calm when it matters most?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/a1bfe89aedf3533d607a988e3d380a49.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/a1bfe89aedf3533d607a988e3d380a49.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/a1bfe89aedf3533d607a988e3d380a49.mp4?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up and Prepare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience and resources to upgrade your gear. Grow your abilities through a branching skill tree and shape your own playstyle. Every raid makes your character stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/c46d97475be1d5a1460c41cc087d271e.poster.avif?t=1785069274\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765790/extras/c46d97475be1d5a1460c41cc087d271e.webm?t=1785069274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sha